	(descr "PCB-side wire landing pads for the Milliohm HoRX-50W-xxR family (C2923747 class, LCSC). REAL-PART CORRECTION (2026-07-16 Phase A finding, testers/tester-standard/pin-audit-review-2026-07-16.txt): this part is a CHASSIS-MOUNT aluminum-housed wirewound resistor (body 50.00x29.00x15.49mm, flanges + solder lugs -- DigiKey mechanical listing, live-checked), NOT a small radial-lead THT resistor. It mounts off-board on the chassis R-bank plates (DESIGN-SHEET.md sec B/G) and connects to the PCB via flying lead wire. This footprint is therefore 2 generic THT wire-landing pads (not a resistor body silhouette) sized for 16-18AWG lead wire.")
